    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. It sounds like you're saying those arguments are basically just distractions. But if a donor asks, \"If the corruption is so widespread that it's a known fact, isn't it actually irresponsible to keep sending money?\" how should I respond to that without sounding like I'm ignoring the reality of the situation?",
